- "know, I have no doubt that"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#71 (mes)
- "you'll become a Gunslinger."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#72 (mes)
- "[Master Miller]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#73 (mes)
- "Hey, you have leftover"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#74 (mes)
- "Skill Points. You better"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#75 (mes)
- "use them all up before you"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#76 (mes)
- "come and talk to me again."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#77 (mes)
- "[Master Miller]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#78 (mes)
- "Oh, you've brought a"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#79 (mes)
- "voucher from Wise Bull Horn?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#80 (mes)
- "It's been a while since he's"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#81 (mes)
- "given one to anybody, so"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#82 (mes)
- "I'm really proud of you!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#83 (mes)
- "[Master Miller]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#84 (mes)
- "If Wise Bull Horn approves,"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#85 (mes)
- "then I have no reason to"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#86 (mes)
- "reject you. Alright then, I'll"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#87 (mes)
- "promote you to a Gunslinger."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#88 (mes)
- "But first, let me explain"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#89 (mes)
- "our job in more detail."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#90 (mes)
- "[Master Miller]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#91 (mes)
- "As a Gunslinger, you must"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#92 (mes)
- "keep your gun with you at"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#93 (mes)
- "all times. The Gunslinger"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#94 (mes)
- "Guild keeps track of every Gun"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#95 (mes)
- "and Bullet, so you can only get"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#96 (mes)
- "them from our guild members."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#97 (mes)
- "[Master Miller]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#98 (mes)
- "Don't worry, Gunslinger"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#99 (mes)
- "Guildsmen can be found almost"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#100 (mes)
- "anywhere these days. Anyway,"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#101 (mes)
- "it has to be this way by order of our guild leader, Lady Selena."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#102 (mes)
- "[Master Miller]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#103 (mes)
- "You might get the chance to"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#104 (mes)
- "meet her one of these days."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#105 (mes)
- "Anyway, just now that we have"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#106 (mes)
- "to regulate Gun and Bullet sales to keep them away from evil"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#107 (mes)
- "or irresponsible folk."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#108 (mes)
- "[Master Miller]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#109 (mes)
- "In any case, it's always"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#110 (mes)
- "a pleasure for me to talk"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#111 (mes)
- "to another Gunslinger, so"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#112 (mes)
- "let's keep in touch. May the"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#113 (mes)
- "power of the earth protect"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#114 (mes)
- "you in all of your adventures~"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#116 (mes)
- "[Master Miller]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#117 (mes)
- "Oh! Long time, no see,"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#118 (mes)
- "friend. How have you been?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#119 (mes)
- "I hope you've been keeping"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#120 (mes)
- "you Gun well maintained."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#121 (mes)
- "Take care of it, and it'll take"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#122 (mes)
- "care of you. Remember it."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#123 (mes)
- "[Master Miller]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#124 (mes)
- "If you don't have"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#125 (mes)
- "any business with me,"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#126 (mes)
- "then please go on your way."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#127 (mes)
- "[Wise Bull Horn]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#128 (mes)
- "Hello, young wolf."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#129 (mes)
- "What business has"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#130 (mes)
- "brought you before me?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#131 (mes)
- "["
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#132 (mes)
- "]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#133 (mes)
- "Mr. Miller sent me to"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#134 (mes)
- "deliver this letter to you."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#135 (mes)
- "Actually, I'm interested in"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#136 (mes)
- "becoming a Gunslinger..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#137 (mes)
- "[Wise Bull Horn]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#138 (mes)
- "Miller, you said?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#139 (mes)
- "Hm, the Black Fox doesn't"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#140 (mes)
- "give introductions for anyone"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#141 (mes)
- "he doesn't believe will make"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#142 (mes)
- "a good Gunslinger. Yes, I think"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#143 (mes)
- "I know why he sent you to me."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#144 (mes)
- "[Wise Bull Horn]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#145 (mes)
- "I can see it in your eyes:"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#146 (mes)
- "you've got a warm heart and a"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#147 (mes)
- "strong sense of responsibility."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#148 (mes)
- "All you need is the blessing"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#149 (mes)
- "of the Earth to protect you"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#150 (mes)
- "as a Gunslinger."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#151 (mes)
- "[Wise Bull Horn]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#152 (mes)
- "I can make a voucher that"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#153 (mes)
- "will demonstrate your desire"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#154 (mes)
- "to become a warrior of the"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#155 (mes)
- "earth for you to present to"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#156 (mes)
- "Gunslinger drillmasters."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#157 (mes)
- "I shall need these items..."
