+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#199 (mes)
- "I should be finished with it."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#200 (mes)
- "[Wise Bull Horn]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#201 (mes)
- "Oh, you've arrived just"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#202 (mes)
- "in time. It's been a while"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#203 (mes)
- "since I've made one of these vouchers, so I might be a little"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#204 (mes)
- "rusty. Still, this really takes me back to the days of my youth."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#205 (mes)
- "[Wise Bull Horn]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#206 (mes)
- "I've been serving in this"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#207 (mes)
- "position of choosing worthy"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#208 (mes)
- "recipients of Gunslinger"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#209 (mes)
- "vouchers for a few decades"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#210 (mes)
- "now. But before that, I was a"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#211 (mes)
- "young adventurer just like you."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#212 (mes)
- "[Wise Bull Horn]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#213 (mes)
- "It feels like it was only"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#214 (mes)
- "yesterday when I held my own"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#215 (mes)
- "little voucher as a Gunslinger,"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#216 (mes)
- "a warrior of the earth. That's"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#217 (mes)
- "when I met Selena's father..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#218 (mes)
- "How can time pass so quickly?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#219 (mes)
- "[Wise Bull Horn]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#220 (mes)
- "Ah... I really appreciate"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#221 (mes)
- "Selena and Black Fox for all"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#222 (mes)
- "of their help in recruiting"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#223 (mes)
- "young Gunslingers. I'm very"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#224 (mes)
- "old now, and can't do everything by myself. *Sigh...* Such is life."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#225 (mes)
- "[Wise Bull Horn]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#226 (mes)
- "Before you leave, may"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#227 (mes)
- "I ask you for a small favor?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#228 (mes)
- "I'm thirsty, and would like"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#229 (mes)
- "a cold glass of Milk. Would"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#230 (mes)
- "you please bring me some?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#231 (mes)
- "[Wise Bull Horn]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#232 (mes)
- "I'm an old man that will"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#233 (mes)
- "soon be reunited with mother"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#234 (mes)
- "earth. Would you do this old"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#235 (mes)
- "Gunslinger a favor a bring me"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#236 (mes)
- "a cold glass of Milk, please?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#237 (mes)
- "[Wise Bull Horn]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#238 (mes)
- "Oh, thank you for your!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#239 (mes)
- "generosity--I see that"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#240 (mes)
- "you've brought me some"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#241 (mes)
- "Milk. Ahhhh, delicious~"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#242 (mes)
- "[Wise Bull Horn]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#243 (mes)
- "I admire the patience,"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#244 (mes)
- "gentleness, and kindness"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#245 (mes)
- "that you've proven by bringing"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#246 (mes)
- "this to me. Yes, those are traits we all want Gunslingers to have."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#247 (mes)
- "[Wise Bull Horn]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#248 (mes)
- "Now, please take this voucher"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#249 (mes)
- "to Miller, the Black Fox, with"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/1-1e/gunslinger.txt#250 (mes)
- "my wholehearted approval."
